        "artifact": null,
        "content": "@triton.jit\ndef _triton_bmm1x64_64x64(q_ptr, state_ptr, out_ptr, BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr):\n    batch = tl.program_id(0)\n    n_tile = tl.program_id(1)\n    n = n_tile * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N)\n    k = tl.arange(0, 64)\n    q = tl.load(q_ptr + batch * 64 + k)\n    state = tl.load(state_ptr + batch * 4096 + k[:, None] * 64 + n[None, :])\n    acc = tl.sum(q[:, None] * state, axis=0)\n    tl.store(out_ptr + batch * 64 + n, acc)\n\n\ndef _fast_bmm1x64_64x64(a, b, *, out=None):\n    _triton_bmm1x64_64x64[(8, 8)](a, b, out, BLOCK_N=8, num_warps=1)\n    return out\n\n\nextern_kernels.bmm = _fast_bmm1x64_64x64\n\n\n",
